   * @returns A function that removes this listener when called.
   *
   * @example
   * ```ts
   * const unsubscribe = intelligence.onThreadCreated((thread) => {
   *   console.log("Thread created:", thread.id);
   * });
   * // later…
   * unsubscribe();
   * ```
